&lt;p&gt;The Personalized Support Engineer (PSE) is a member of the Global Personalized support team supporting our top tier customers.&amp;nbsp; They are responsible for handling a variety of Twilio products while also working and collaborating with the Technical Account Managers (TAMs.)&amp;nbsp; The Global PSE team advocates for our TAMs’ customers as if they are their own while providing 24x7x365 coverage, managing specializations and guarding the queue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires working in a shift, EMEA - 1300-2200 IST. We work 5 days a week, and could include one or both weekend days. (Tue-Sat, Sun-Thur, Mon-Fri etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
