&lt;p data-start=&quot;1268&quot; data-end=&quot;1369&quot;&gt;Tackle complex challenges for global brands selling on Amazon, Walmart, and other leading retailers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1370&quot; data-end=&quot;1427&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1427&quot;&gt;Be empowered to own your work and grow in your career&lt;/p&gt;
