&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_040282bebe557ab6-19&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;As a ServiceNow Platform Support Specialist, you will ensure the seamless performance, reliability, and continuous improvement of Everpure’s enterprise ServiceNow ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;. You will own the technical resolution of complex L2 incidents and deliver essential run-the-business enhancements that keep our global operations moving at speed. Collaborating closely with cross-functional IT groups, business stakeholders, and core engineering squads, this role serves as the critical bridge between frontline support and long-term platform evolution.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver End-to-End L2 Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive prompt investigation, troubleshooting, and end-to-end resolution of escalated incidents across ServiceNow modules (including ITSM, HRSD, CMDB, and CSM) and critical enterprise integrations (such as Workday and SAP) to maximize platform uptime and user satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ship Run-the-Business Enhancements:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, configure, and release high-impact platform enhancements and keep-the-lights-on updates within our agile scrum framework, aligning continuous delivery to organizational standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Problem &amp;amp; Trend Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze recurring platform incidents and operational data to pinpoint root causes, partnering with L3 engineering teams to eliminate bottlenecks, strengthen platform health, and drive preventative solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Knowledge Enablement &amp;amp; Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with cross-functional teams during project handoffs to author clear technical guides, knowledge base articles, and operational SOPs that elevate first-contact resolution for tier-one support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Readiness &amp;amp; Critical Response:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in scheduled on-call rotations to rapidly mitigate critical, business-impacting operational incidents outside standard hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ServiceNow Administration &amp;amp; Platform Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Certified System Administrator (CSA) credential with proven proficiency in configuring core ServiceNow workflows, managing platform security, building custom reporting dashboards, and maintaining enterprise system health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Diagnostics &amp;amp; Integration Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong technical troubleshooting capabilities with the ability to read and analyze JavaScript, evaluate enterprise APIs, and identify issues spanning system integrations and data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated skill in applying structured diagnostic frameworks (such as root-cause analysis) in agile environments, combined with clear, empathetic communication when translating technical solutions to business partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_040282bebe557ab6-20&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workplace Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Bangalore office in compliance with Everpure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TA-Ops@purestorage.com&quot;&gt;TA-Ops@purestorage.com&lt;/a&gt; if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A Payroll Intern – will be learning the payroll activities phase wise and while the role is&amp;nbsp;responsible for supporting Payroll team members with assigned payroll tasks, employee supports (answering emails, filing, collecting data, Payroll Validation and forms collection), and support to maintaining accurate payroll records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here&#39;s a more detailed breakdown of the role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Learnings and Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic activities of Payroll:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This Role will start understanding the Payroll Activities from the Basics to Statutory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on Payroll Activities for North America (US and Canada)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Collection and Verification:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect New hires data, payroll required forms, and other relevant information from New Hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify all information for new hires are correctly completed in these form and other payroll-related data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate the Offer letters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payroll Processing supports
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping with payroll tasks as required by Payroll specialist and Payroll Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to provide the basic level for payroll processing related activities (like validating forma, communifi, commission, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record Keeping and Audit Requirements:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retrieve and manage payroll information as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date payroll records which will be aligned with the Audit requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need to help the team in collating the Audit requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for year-end activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other Duties:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with payroll inquiries from employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare payroll reports and statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May assist with other administrative tasks as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on Statutory Compliance based on country specific.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GL team on payroll Recons and Fluxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Will be supporting the Payroll team in the new development projects to improve the Team Process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills and Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:CA Intern and eligible for industrial training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, both verbal and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite (particularly Excel, Word, and Outlook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a team environment and collaborate with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and accuracy in performing tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and the ability to prioritize tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn and develop new skills in the accounting field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior internship or work experience in Payroll accounting or finance is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and accuracy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in data entry and computer systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;Some experience in payroll processing or accounting is often preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience and mentorship from seasoned professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to diverse accounting tasks and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to develop skills and knowledge in accounting and finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn US and Canada Countries Payroll.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friendly and supportive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our Finance department as Payroll Apprentice will provide you with a solid foundation for a successful career in Payroll Accounting. We encourage you to apply if you are passionate about numbers, eager to learn, and ready to contribute to our team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
