&lt;h3&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate, driven and accomplished Entitlement Analyst to join our growing India team. This is an opportunity to join a high-growth company, and enable an award-winning product that is rapidly getting adopted across international markets. In this role, you will actively support our global sales teams with Content Authorization requests and provide them superior customer experience. As an Entitlement Analyst, you will be responsible to collaborate with sales teams, broker partners, and customers to resolve their concerns in a professional manner.&lt;/p&gt;
