jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At our labor marketplace tech company, we believe that even in the age of AI, the core of success comes down to good people doing honest work. We&#39;re seeking a detail-oriented and automation-savvy Product Operations Analyst to help us optimize our operational processes and ensure data accuracy across our platforms. This is a fantastic opportunity to grow your career at the intersection of operations, data, and intelligent automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Enthusiast:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re passionate about eliminating manual work through automation. You&#39;ve built workflows using tools like n8n, Zapier, or Make.com, and you&#39;re always looking for the next process to optimize.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively leverage AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, or other LLMs to enhance your productivity, solve complex problems, and generate insights. You see AI as a powerful co-pilot in your daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven &amp;amp; Analytical:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable diving into databases using SQL, analyzing trends in Excel or Google Sheets, and creating dashboards to visualize operational metrics. You use data to drive decisions and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Tinkerer:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy building solutions using no-code/low-code platforms like Replit, Retool, or similar tools. You&#39;re not afraid to write simple scripts or work with APIs to connect systems and automate workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimizer: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a natural instinct for identifying inefficiencies and redesigning processes. You&#39;re organized, detail-oriented, and obsessed with creating scalable, repeatable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Starter &amp;amp; Collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; You can work independently to manage multiple projects while also partnering effectively with cross-functional teams including Biz-Ops, product, sales, and payroll.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Data Quality &amp;amp; Integrity: &lt;/strong&gt;Implement and maintain robust processes for validating and verifying data accuracy, consistency, and completeness across all platforms. Develop and enforce data quality standards that become the foundation of operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Deploy Automation Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement automation workflows using N8n, Zapier, or custom scripts to eliminate repetitive manual tasks. Identify bottlenecks in current processes and create scalable automation solutions that improve team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and other LLMs to automate data processing, generate insights, create documentation, and enhance decision-making. Experiment with new AI capabilities to continuously improve operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage End-to-End Projects: &lt;/strong&gt;Own short-term and long-term operational projects with comprehensive documentation and strict adherence to timelines. Define performance metrics, accuracy benchmarks, and provide proactive updates to stakeholders throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Process Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously identify opportunities to streamline operations through automation, better tooling, and process redesign. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to implement solutions that reduce manual work and improve data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across Functions:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Biz-Ops, product management, engineering, billing ops, and sales teams to understand data requirements and operational needs. Collaborate on initiatives that enhance data accessibility and usability for all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Information Technology, Computer Science, Data Analytics, or a related field is preferred but not required if you have equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; Development Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with Python, JavaScript, or other scripting languages for building custom automation solutions and data processing scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;API &amp;amp; Integration Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with REST APIs, webhooks, and system integrations to connect disparate platforms and automate data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Visualization Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience creating dashboards and reports using Tableau, Power BI, Looker, or similar visualization tools to communicate insights to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working in a fast-paced startup environment where you wore multiple hats and adapted quickly to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Empathy, Trust &amp;amp; Candor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We put ourselves in the shoes of our colleagues and customers and don’t shy away from uncomfortable conversations, instead building trust through honest and direct feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We practice high-velocity decision-making, clear-eyed that we often operate with incomplete information. Growing quickly means it’s OK to be wrong, so long as we learn from our mistakes and course correct!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Always Be Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re a curious bunch, and with AI transforming our workplace we encourage everyone to learn from each other, compounding our knowledge and experience to help us change an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We work long, hard, and smart, building products that delight our users and drive growth. Your ability to impact Instawork is limited only by your courage and conviction, not your job description.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Instawork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instawork.com&quot;&gt;Instawork&lt;/a&gt; is the nation’s leading online labor marketplace for food services, hospitality, light industry, and logistics, connecting more than 7M skilled workers with local restaurants, hotels, warehouses, stadiums, and more. Our AI-powered platform serves thousands of businesses across more than 50 major markets in the United States and Canada. We&#39;re not just helping fill shifts, we&#39;re supporting local economies—and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instawork has been featured by CBS News, The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, and the Associated Press. Forbes included us on their Next Billion Dollar Startups list; RetailTech Breakthrough named us Workforce Hiring Solution of the Year for 2025; and Inc. 5000 recognized us as one of the country&#39;s top 10% fastest-growing companies two years in a row. But what matters most is our impact. We&#39;re solving real problems for real people, and we’re doing it at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team to help us build something that matters! We’re looking for superstars who want to help us shape the future of work. With hubs in San Francisco, Bangalore, and Chicago, city offices in New York and Phoenix, we&#39;re back to working together in-person five days a week because we believe the best ideas happen when great people collaborate face-to-face. We also value diverse perspectives and encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to make an impact? Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.instawork.com/about&quot;&gt;www.instawork.com/about&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.instawork.com/legal/california-personnel-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers are at the forefront of some of the most interesting data in the world, using SingleStore to push the boundaries every day. To do this well, they leverage the expertise of our Support Engineering Team, composed of technical subject matter experts on the frontline of critical customer issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Support Engineering role skews far more towards engineering than typical technical support as you will need to delve into database internals and memory allocators, investigate Linux and host-related configurations, and diagnose SQL query behaviour, all in the name of resolving complex database issues. Our Support Engineers are constantly learning a wide range of customer systems and technical concepts and are thrilled by the new and exciting challenges that they encounter on a regular basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To accurately identify the source and solution of an issue, this team will take the time to learn about the customer’s business and systems while helping to improve their fundamental SingleStore and database operational knowledge. This often requires additional research and time spent on learning new technologies and tools outside of SingleStore while also being deeply engaged with multiple departments including development teams, query performance engineering, product management, infrastructure SREs, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Hours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The hours required are from 11:30 AM IST - 8:30 PM IST (9 hours) for 5 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in our on-call rotation that may include weekends and holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide email and live technical support to our enterprise customers, acting as the first line of defense for complex technical issues, bug diagnosis, or resolving critical outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and reproduce product issues, perform QA, and submit formal bug reports or feature requests to the appropriate Engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with software developers, sales engineers, and technical account managers to keep all teams up to date with current issues a customer may be facing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work to streamline and improve various Support and Engineering processes and tools, author new internal run-books or public documentation, and help the team continually improve efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customers have a positive support experience during every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of advanced customer-facing technical support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MySQL or MySQL-like (MariaDB, Aurora, etc) database and SQL Query Optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid Kubernetes and sysadmin skill set. Also, comfortable testing software and finding its limits, hands-on with Linux, checking utilization of system I/O, measuring network throughput, and are comfortable navigating large log files.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a scripting or coding language. Whether it’s Python, Bash, or Go, you should have a go-to solution for quick and dirty problem-solving and be able to navigate through our code base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed systems and AWS/GCP. You understand how organizations deploy and maintain distributed applications and services across multiple machines Bonus points for knowing how to analyze them for performance bottlenecks and remove single points of failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal English communication skills. Have the ability to explain technical concepts to a wide range of end-users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore delivers the cloud-native database with the speed and scale to power the world’s data-intensive applications. With a distributed SQL database that introduces simplicity to your data architecture by unifying transactions and analytics, SingleStore empowers digital leaders to deliver exceptional, real-time data experiences to their customers. SingleStore is venture-backed and headquartered in San Francisco with offices in Sunnyvale, Raleigh, Seattle, Boston, London, Lisbon, Bangalore, Dublin and Kyiv.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistent with our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion, we value individuals with the ability to work on diverse teams and with a diverse range of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For candidates residing in California, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/singlestore-california-recruitment-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. For candidates residing in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/recruitment-privacy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; EEA, UK, and Swiss Recruitment Privacy Notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;COG00073&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Manager – High Value Devices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Function:&lt;/strong&gt; Operations – Asset &amp;amp; Inventory Control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Type:&lt;/strong&gt; High-Value Electronic Assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools Used:&lt;/strong&gt; Manual Registers &amp;amp; Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Mode:&lt;/strong&gt; On-site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Inventory Manager will be responsible for end-to-end custody, tracking, and reconciliation of high-value inventory, primarily iPhones and related accessories such as SD cards and card readers. This role demands strict control, zero tolerance for mismatches, and complete documentation discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;No inventory movement is allowed without entries, and physical stock must always tally with records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Morning Shift - 7 am to 4 pm; Evening Shift -&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;4 pm to 2 am)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. High-Value Inventory Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Take complete ownership of &lt;strong&gt;high-value devices and accessories&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure &lt;strong&gt;serial-number–level tracking&lt;/strong&gt; for all devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain &lt;strong&gt;zero loss and zero undocumented movement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2. Inward Inventory Management (IT → Inventory)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Receive devices and accessories from the IT team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Verify:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Quantity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serial numbers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Physical condition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Record all inward movements &lt;strong&gt;immediately&lt;/strong&gt; in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manual registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Escalate any mismatch, damage, or discrepancy without delay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3. Outward Inventory Management (Inventory ↔ Field Ops)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hand over inventory from:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Inventory to Field Ops (FO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Field Ops back to Inventory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure &lt;strong&gt;no item goes out without prior entry&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Capture details including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Item name and serial number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;FO name / ID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Date and time of handover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expected return date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Avoid all verbal or informal handovers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Returns, Reconciliation &amp;amp; Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Receive returned inventory and re-verify serial numbers and condition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Update return entries on the same day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong&gt;daily reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt; between:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Physical stock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Items with Field Ops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Track overdue or missing items and follow up proactively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Documentation &amp;amp; Audit Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain clean, structured Google Sheets trackers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure inventory area access is controlled.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support audits and internal checks as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain high compliance standards for asset handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience handling &lt;strong&gt;high-value inventory or assets&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Google Sheets&lt;/strong&gt; (filters, basic formulas).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;manual inventory registers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;High attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in inventory, warehouse, logistics, or operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing electronic devices or serialized assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong ownership and accountability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Process-driven with a &lt;strong&gt;zero-error mindset&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;High integrity and discipline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working under strict controls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;100% match between physical inventory and records&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zero undocumented inventory movement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zero asset loss due to process lapses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Timely reconciliation and reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Empathy, Trust &amp;amp; Candor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We put ourselves in the shoes of our colleagues and customers and don’t shy away from uncomfortable conversations, instead building trust through honest and direct feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We practice high-velocity decision-making, clear-eyed that we often operate with incomplete information. Growing quickly means it’s OK to be wrong, so long as we learn from our mistakes and course correct!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Always Be Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re a curious bunch, and with AI transforming our workplace we encourage everyone to learn from each other, compounding our knowledge and experience to help us change an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We work long, hard, and smart, building products that delight our users and drive growth. Your ability to impact Instawork is limited only by your courage and conviction, not your job description.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Instawork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instawork.com&quot;&gt;Instawork&lt;/a&gt; is the nation’s leading online labor marketplace for food services, hospitality, light industry, and logistics, connecting more than 7M skilled workers with local restaurants, hotels, warehouses, stadiums, and more. Our AI-powered platform serves thousands of businesses across more than 50 major markets in the United States and Canada. We&#39;re not just helping fill shifts, we&#39;re supporting local economies—and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instawork has been featured by CBS News, The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, and the Associated Press. Forbes included us on their Next Billion Dollar Startups list; RetailTech Breakthrough named us Workforce Hiring Solution of the Year for 2025; and Inc. 5000 recognized us as one of the country&#39;s top 10% fastest-growing companies two years in a row. But what matters most is our impact. We&#39;re solving real problems for real people, and we’re doing it at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team to help us build something that matters! We’re looking for superstars who want to help us shape the future of work. With hubs in San Francisco, Bangalore, and Chicago, city offices in New York and Phoenix, we&#39;re back to working together in-person five days a week because we believe the best ideas happen when great people collaborate face-to-face. We also value diverse perspectives and encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to make an impact? Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.instawork.com/about&quot;&gt;www.instawork.com/about&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.instawork.com/legal/california-personnel-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Team:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Order Processing Team helps in managing the sales contract management and provisioning,&amp;nbsp; to meet company financial and legal requirements as well as processing deadlines. The team is responsible for validating the opportunity and contract information, processing the deals, and activating the user access. At our core, we are a dynamic team of highly productive people who are passionate about providing support and who thrive in a rapidly changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate, driven and accomplished Order Processing Analyst to join our growing India team. This is an opportunity to join a high-growth company, and enable an award-winning product that is rapidly getting adopted across international markets. In this role, you will work with Sales Operations, Content Authorization, Legal, Finance, and other internal teams to execute the order lifecycle process (order processing, sales contract management and provisioning) to meet company financial and legal requirements as well as processing deadlines. This role also utilizes problem-solving and project management skills in coordination with organizational and relational abilities to promote operational excellence, customer service, and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-focused individual, who has experience in supporting the customers through an email ticketing system, chat, and/or phone calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide comprehensive information/updates to the sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve customer complaints and queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide new employees with training sessions to enhance their skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer exceptional customer service and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with customers for any further information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a healthy relationship with the sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an ability to execute, act tactically and write effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a desire to learn and absorb information to make connections and drive productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong analytical, critical thinking, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player and enjoy building strong cross-group working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Office Suites (especially in Excel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce or any CRM tools experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high change, rapidly growing business is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process the new and renewal orders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate the opportunity and contact information, and flag and resolve any discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn on client access and confirm the opportunity for the further processing (i.e. sending the invoices)&lt;/li&gt;
