&lt;p&gt;AlphaSense is seeking multiple skilled transcript editors to join our team and contribute to the seamless conversion of recorded events (interviews, webcasts, phone calls, etc.), into accurate and organized transcripts for use by AlphaSense’s clients. The ideal candidate will possess exceptional listening skills, solid English grammar skills, the ability to work quickly and efficiently while delivering a high quality product, and strong attention to detail. The role principally entails editing transcripts to match audio files verbatim, correctly identifying speaker names, product names, and numbers, as well as correcting grammar and punctuation, all within tight turnaround times.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
