&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Groww:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are a passionate group of people focused on making financial services accessible to every Indian through a multi-product platform. Each day, we help millions of customers take charge of their financial journey. Customer obsession is in our DNA. Every product, every design, every algorithm down to the tiniest detail is executed keeping the customers’ needs and convenience in mind. Our people are our greatest strength. Everyone at Groww is driven by ownership, customer-centricity, integrity and the passion to constantly challenge the status quo.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Are you as passionate about defying conventions and creating something extraordinary as we are? Let’s chat.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Every individual deserves the knowledge, tools, and confidence to make informed financial decisions. At Groww, we are making sure every Indian feels empowered to do so through a cutting-edge multi-product platform offering a variety of financial services. Our long-term vision is to become the trusted financial partner for millions of Indians.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our culture enables us to be what we are — India’s fastest-growing financial services company. It fosters an environment where collaboration, transparency, and open communication take center-stage and hierarchies fade away. There is space for every individual to be themselves and feel motivated to bring their best to the table, as well as craft a promising career for themselves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The values that form our foundation are:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Radical customer centricity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership-driven culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping everything simple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete transparency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re looking for an Illustrator to join our creative team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create illustrations and visual assets for campaigns, social media, brand, events and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ideas, information and data into simple, engaging visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create data visualisations that make complex information easy to understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with designers, copywriters and creative leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle multiple projects and tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–4 years of experience in illustration or visual design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio and good visual sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of composition, colour and typography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;data visualisation&lt;/strong&gt; and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop. Figma is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good attention to detail and strong execution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well under pressure and within tight timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, collaborative and open to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;About Enterpret&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Enterpret, we are building the customer intelligence platform that turns millions of raw, messy pieces of customer feedback into a structured, queryable source of truth, solving complex problems in natural language processing, serverless computing, and real-time analytics by applying first-principle thinking to systems that operate at massive scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are AI-native to the core. Our models, pipelines, and infrastructure are designed around AI from the ground up, and our engineers ship these features to production at scale. Our investors are Kleiner Perkins and Sequoia Capital, and a few of our customers are Canva, Notion, and Wispr Flow, among many other customer-centric product orgs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We love working with folks who are resourceful, curious, and take ownership of their work. Our internship program isn&#39;t about side projects, it&#39;s a launchpad. You&#39;ll take on meaningful problems, learn quickly, and directly impact the systems our customers rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our engineering culture is built around leveraging and contributing to open-source tools. We aim to build upon and improve state-of-the-art systems in our field of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Read more about our team, core values, and operating principles - &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.enterpret.com/careers&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our backend team is small but exceptionally strong, so you&#39;ll learn fast and get real ownership early, with experienced engineers alongside you the whole way. You&#39;ll get to build things from scratch and see how your systems hold up in the real world, with all its messy data, unexpected user behavior, and edge cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;And when something breaks (it happens to all of us), you&#39;ll dig in with the team to make it faster and more resilient than before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our system design discussions&lt;/strong&gt;: sit in on internal design and implementation conversations and contribute your ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take ideas from concept to production&lt;/strong&gt;: build real solutions with guidance, not just closing tickets off a backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop on &lt;strong&gt;serverless architectures using AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, building scalable backend components that stand up to real-world use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build &lt;strong&gt;proof-of-concepts for new backend + AI feature integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, from model output to real-time inference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the engineers building our AI-native platform and learn how backend architecture supports AI features end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What It Takes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite in Bangalore is a must-have:&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;re able and willing to work from our Bangalore office in person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a degree in Computer Science or Engineering from a Tier 1 college.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong programming fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt; in any modern language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one prior internship in a relevant engineering or backend/AI role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems, serverless computing, and AI-powered product features.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp problem-solving, debugging, and analytical skills, and an eagerness to learn how backend architecture supports AI from model training to real-time inference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;: open-source contributions or backend/AI project experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Enterpret?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Your code ships to production and reaches features used by companies like Canva and Notion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Real autonomy and ownership of what you build, with support when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn by Doing&lt;/strong&gt;: Get hands-on with AI, data, and scalable systems that most interns only read about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;: Learn directly from engineers who have scaled AI-native systems, plus L&amp;amp;D resources in backend + AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;: An open, collaborative, builder-first environment where it&#39;s safe to experiment, ask questions, and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive internship stipend, and a potential Pre-Placement Offer (PPO) based on your performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Value&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Enterpret, we operate with a deep sense of ownership, we play for the team and do what it takes to win together. We care personally for our teammates while pushing each other with honest, actionable feedback. Above all, we approach everything with humility and a drive to keep learning and getting better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We ensure that none of our employees or prospective employees receives less favourable treatment as a result of age, sex, disability, marital status, colour, race, religion or ethnic origin. Equally we aim to ensure that no such employee is disadvantaged by terms and conditions of employment which cannot be justified.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;HackerRank helps companies like NVIDIA, Amazon, and Microsoft hire and upskill the next generation of developers based on skills, not pedigree. Our platform is trusted by over 2,500 of the world’s most innovative companies to build strong engineering teams ready for what’s next.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Software has entered an era where humans and AI build side by side. As this shift accelerates, the definition of strong technical talent is changing. We give companies better ways to identify and invest in next-generation skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;People at HackerRank care deeply about the impact of their work and sweat the small details so our customers can be wildly successful with products they genuinely love to use. We move with urgency and believe great outcomes come from high standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a high-performing DevOps team responsible for evolving our cloud infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, and observability frameworks across environments.&amp;nbsp;You’ll have the autonomy to design, build, and optimise our infrastructure systems while enabling developer productivity at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain CI/CD pipelines for all HackerRank environments from development to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate infrastructure using Terraform, Docker, and Kubernetes (EKS), ensuring scalability and reproducibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and evangelise DevOps best practices across engineering teams, CI/CD hygiene, observability, and cost-efficient architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain monitoring, alerting, and incident response systems using tools like OpsGenie, New Relic, and ELK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise the performance and utilisation of key systems such as Redis, RDS, Redshift, ElasticSearch, and Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with security and platform teams to ensure compliance, resilience, and threat protection across cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cloud cost optimisation initiatives and infrastructure efficiency projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 3+ years of experience in DevOps, SRE, or Cloud Infrastructure Engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise with AWS &lt;em&gt;(and ideally some exposure to GCP)&lt;/em&gt;, including EKS, EC2, S3, SQS, and IAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes, and Linux (Ubuntu)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on scripting or coding skills in Python or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of monitoring, alerting, and performance tuning principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborator who can partner with developers, QA, and leadership teams to drive platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing ArgoCD, Jenkins, or other CI/CD orchestration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in security engineering, threat modelling, or penetration testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of observability frameworks and modern APM tools (New Relic, Prometheus, Grafana).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in cost optimisation and infrastructure scaling for high-traffic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with multi-cloud or hybrid environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a builder’s mindset to automate processes, simplify workflows, and empower others through effective tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about reliability, scalability, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoying owning systems end-to-end and solving production challenges hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances technical depth with empathy, understanding that infrastructure is successful only when developers can move faster and safer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in creating calm out of complexity and designing systems that just work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to learn more about HackerRank?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Check out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://hackerrank.com/&quot;&gt;HackerRank.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to explore our products, solutions and resources, and dive into our story and mission&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hackerrank.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HackerRank is a proud equal employment opportunity and affirmative action employer. We provide equal opportunity to everyone for employment based on individual performance and qualification. We never discriminate based on race, religion, national origin, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, marital, veteran, or disability status. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/hackerrank/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/hackerrank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/hackerrank/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.hackerrank.com/?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_content=signature&quot;&gt;Blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/hackerrank?igsh=MWNid2d6aWlxYnl0OQ==&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeathackerrank?igsh=eDFta3owaTJsbW5x&quot;&gt;Life@HackerRank&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Notice to prospective HackerRank job applicants:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our Recruiters use @hackerrank.com email addresses.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;We never ask for payment or credit check information to apply, interview, or work here.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type: Contract / Internship (High-Commitment)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Bengaluru (On-site)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: Extensive travel across India&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: 6 Months&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Hours: 6 days/week | Project-dependent hours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Trainer (Intern) to support the onboarding, training, assessment, and certification of Field Operators&amp;nbsp;working on large-scale field operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a hands-on training role, not a conventional classroom-only position. You will be responsible for taking&amp;nbsp;candidates through the complete training journey, from onboarding and practical training to assessment and certification.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role requires extensive travel across India, strong communication skills, confidence in managing groups, and the&amp;nbsp;ability to strictly enforce SOPs and make objective certification decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;1. Training &amp;amp; Onboarding&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Conduct classroom and hands-on training sessions for Field Operators.|&lt;br&gt;Explain SOPs, technical processes, and field procedures in a simple and actionable manner.&lt;br&gt;Demonstrate correct equipment handling and operating procedures.&lt;br&gt;Manage training batches and maintain discipline, engagement, and focus.&lt;br&gt;Take ownership of trainees from onboarding through certification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Assessment &amp;amp; Certification&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Conduct knowledge quizzes and practical assessments.&lt;br&gt;Evaluate candidates against defined assessment criteria.&lt;br&gt;Make objective Select / Reject decisions based on performance.&lt;br&gt;Provide corrective coaching and feedback where required.&lt;br&gt;Ensure only candidates meeting the required standard are certified and deployed.&lt;br&gt;Maintain certification standards even when there is pressure to increase deployment numbers.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Field Training &amp;amp; Travel&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Travel extensively across India to conduct training at different locations.&lt;br&gt;Conduct training and practical assessments in field environments.&lt;br&gt;Support newly certified Field Operators during initial deployment when required.&lt;br&gt;Adapt to changing locations, schedules, batch sizes, and operational requirements.&lt;br&gt;Be comfortable spending extended periods away from Bengaluru when required.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Quality, Reporting &amp;amp; Improvement&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Ensure Field Operators follow SOPs and critical operational requirements correctly.&lt;br&gt;Identify recurring mistakes and process gaps during training.&lt;br&gt;Maintain accurate records of attendance, assessment scores, and certification status.&lt;br&gt;Share regular updates on training progress and candidate performance.&lt;br&gt;Provide feedback and suggestions to improve training content and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;● &lt;/strong&gt;Communication: Strong verbal communication in multiple Indian languages and ability to explain instructions&amp;nbsp;clearly to individuals and groups.&lt;br&gt;● Command &amp;amp; Presence: Confident managing groups, maintaining discipline, and keeping trainees focused.&lt;br&gt;● Decisiveness: Comfortable making firm pass/fail and Select/Reject decisions based on objective criteria.&lt;br&gt;● Process Discipline: Strong attention to detail and willingness to enforce SOPs exactly as defined.&lt;br&gt;● Hands-On Approach: Comfortable working directly with equipment and trainees in field environments.&lt;br&gt;● Travel Readiness: Willingness to travel extensively across India is mandatory.&lt;br&gt;● Accountability: Takes ownership of training quality, candidate readiness, certification, and documentation.&lt;br&gt;● Adaptability: Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment with changing schedules and locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;● 6 months–1 year of relevant experience in training, field operations, technical operations, customer support, or a&amp;nbsp;similar role.&lt;br&gt;● Strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;br&gt;● Comfortable speaking to and managing groups of people.&lt;br&gt;● Training, onboarding, demonstration, or group-handling experience is preferred.&lt;br&gt;● Experience with technical equipment, hardware, robotics, data collection, or field operations is a plus.&lt;br&gt;● Basic proficiency in Google Workspace / MS Office.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who This Role Is For&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;● Individuals who are comfortable travelling extensively across different cities and field locations.&lt;br&gt;● People who enjoy teaching, coaching, and working with others.&lt;br&gt;● Confident individuals who can manage a training room and maintain authority.&lt;br&gt;● People who are comfortable working hands-on in field environments.&lt;br&gt;● Individuals who can enforce rules and make difficult decisions when required.&lt;br&gt;● Disciplined, punctual, adaptable, and highly accountable individuals.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who This Role Is NOT For&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;● People unwilling to travel extensively.&lt;br&gt;● Individuals looking for a fixed-location, desk-based role.&lt;br&gt;● Those uncomfortable working in field environments.&lt;br&gt;● Individuals uncomfortable enforcing strict processes or rejecting candidates who do not meet the required standard.&lt;br&gt;● People who prefer a predictable routine and are unwilling to adapt to changing schedules and locations.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Success Metrics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;● Training Effectiveness: Field Operators demonstrate the required knowledge and practical competency after&amp;nbsp;training.&lt;br&gt;● Certification Quality: Only candidates meeting defined standards are certified and deployed.&lt;br&gt;● Deployment Readiness: Certified Field Operators perform required processes correctly with minimal&amp;nbsp;intervention.&lt;br&gt;● Documentation Accuracy: Training, assessment, and certification records are maintained accurately.&lt;br&gt;● Process Improvement: Identify recurring training gaps and contribute actionable improvements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
