&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DevRev&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DevRev, we&#39;re building the future of work with &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; – your AI teammate. Unlike traditional tools, &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; unifies all your data sources, tools, and workflows into a single AI-ready platform, giving employees real-time insights, proactive suggestions, and powerful agentic actions. It extends your existing software with AI-native apps and agents that work alongside your teams and customers – updating workflows, coordinating across teams, and eliminating repetitive work. We call this Team Intelligence: human-AI collaboration that breaks down silos, brings people back together, and frees you to solve bigger problems. Backed by Khosla Ventures and Mayfield with $150M+ raised, DevRev is trusted by global companies across industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for domain-first, systems-oriented engineers domain-first, systems-oriented engineers who understand how real-world systems (in renewable energy,automotive, manufacturing, IoT, etc.) generate and use data — and can translate that into meaningful AI-driven&amp;nbsp;workflows using DevRev.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, you will act as a trusted advisortrusted advisor, combining domain expertise, engineering depth, and problem-domain expertise, engineering depth, and problem-solving to help customers unlock value from their data through DevRev’s AI platform.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering to design solutions that go beyond demos — enabling real-real-world automation, intelligence, and agentic workflowsworld automation, intelligence, and agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customers to deeply understand domain workflows, systems, and data flows domain workflows, systems, and data flows (e.g., connected vehicles, factory systems, IoT environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate real-world signals (sensor data, logs, events) into insights, workflows, and automated actions insights, workflows, and automated actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and showcase AI-driven workflows, automations, and agentic use casesAI-driven workflows, automations, and agentic use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and articulate end-to-end solutions end-to-end solutions (data ingestion → processing → decision → action)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical advisor technical advisor, guiding customers on how DevRev can integrate into and enhance their existing systemsDeliver tailored demos, PoCs, and solution walkthroughs demos, PoCs, and solution walkthroughs grounded in real-world use cases (not generic SaaS demos)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integrations with external systems via APIs, webhooks, and data pipelinesAPIs, webhooks, and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical proposals, RFP/RFI responses technical proposals, RFP/RFI responses, and solution architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry trends (renewable energy, automotive, manufacturing, IoT, AI)industry trends (renewable energy, automotive, manufacturing, IoT, AI) and bring insights into customer conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
