&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;system-level thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data pipelines, APIs, integrations, distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python / TypeScript / JavaScript (or similar)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;system design, reliability, and failure handling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI/ML in industrial use cases (vision systems, predictive maintenance, log-stream analysis, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Use Case Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data → insights → workflows → actions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;end-to-end systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset to identify automation opportunities from real-world signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;LLMs, RAG, AI agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with prompt design and AI workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Postman, GitHub, Jira, Cursor, Claude Code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How do we work? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whatever your role, our values describe what we ask of each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a bridger&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Look beyond your own role. Ask questions, share context and help others get unstuck. That may mean bringing the right people together or picking up a problem that doesn’t necessarily fit neatly into your job description.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Care loudly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want your perspective, not just your agreement. Speak up when something isn’t working or someone needs support. Give honest feedback with respect for the person receiving it. Don’t let an uncomfortable conversation become an unspoken problem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Take responsibility for the result, not just your part in the process. Use AI to move the work forward, not to outsource your judgment. Make the call, check whether it worked and change course when it didn’t. If something goes wrong, own it and help fix it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That’s DevRev!&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;DevRev is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

